A good scene brings us into the personal so that&nbsp;
we feel the personal as well as understanding how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:47.520
it's a step in the external plot what do a lot&nbsp;
of new writers get wrong when they write scenes&nbsp;&nbsp;

